Package: cepgen
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Generic central exclusive processes event generator
 CepGen is a generic central exclusive processes event generator. It
 provides a modular framework to compute cross sections and to generate
 events for photon-induced and other central exclusive processes in hadron
 and lepton colliders.

Package: cepgen-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: cepgen (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Generic central exclusive processes event generator - development files
 CepGen is a generic central exclusive processes event generator.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the CMake find module needed to build
 programs and plugins against the CepGen libraries.

Package: cepgen-lhapdf
Architecture: any
Depends: cepgen (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Generic central exclusive processes event generator - LHAPDF add-on
 CepGen add-on library interfacing the LHAPDF parton distribution functions.

Package: cepgen-hepmc3
Architecture: any
Depends: cepgen (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Generic central exclusive processes event generator - HepMC3 add-on
 CepGen add-on library to export events in the HepMC3 format.

Package: cepgen-pythia8
Architecture: any
Depends: cepgen (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Generic central exclusive processes event generator - Pythia 8 add-on
 CepGen add-on library interfacing the Pythia 8 hadronisation and decay engine.
